{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "67e574a1-62fe-8f24-8ac0-1c1fcd0f1764",
  "created_at": "2026-03-04T14:40:00-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Odete Tavares",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:36:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good afternoon, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:36:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, madam. Thank you for taking my call. My name is Odete Tavares. I am calling about a problem in the street, a manhole cover."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:36:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a manhole cover. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:36:36-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It has sunk down, lower than the road. Every time a car goes over it, it makes a loud ring, like a metal bell. [pause] Excuse me, I drank too much coffee this morning and I am a little jittery, so please forgive me if I talk fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:36:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're fine, take your time. Where is the manhole, exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:37:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is in front of the house of my mother, at 306 Dean Avenue. I am calling for her, because she does not like to use the telephone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:37:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 306 Dean Avenue. Is the cover in the travel lane, or off to the side by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:37:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] ...in the lane, madam, where the cars drive. Maybe one meter from the curb. The cars go over it all day and it rings each time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:37:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it's in the travel lane, about a meter out from the curb, and it's sunk below the pavement and rattling when cars cross. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:37:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly right. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:37:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Has the cover shifted or moved at all, or is it still sitting in its frame?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:37:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is still in the frame, I think. It is only low. The asphalt around it is a little broken also."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:38:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I'll note the broken asphalt around it too. Anything else you've seen there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:38:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, one more question, please. If a car is damaged by this, a tire or the wheel, does the city reimburse the cost? My neighbor says his car had a problem there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:38:21-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a claim process for vehicle damage, and it gets reviewed case by case. I can't tell you it'd be paid, but you're allowed to file one. I'll have someone send you the information on how to do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:38:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. So it is not automatic, but one can ask."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:38:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Do you want to give me a callback number in case someone needs to reach you about the work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:38:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one six zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:38:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-oh. Perfect. And that's under Odete Tavares?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:39:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Odete, O-D-E-T-E, Tavares, T-A-V-A-R-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:39:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I've got the request in. A crew will look at it and decide what kind of repair it needs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:39:13-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Could you please give me a reference number for this report? So I can say it to my mother, and to ask later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:39:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, hang on a second while it pulls up. [pause] Okay, your reference number is W-O, two-six, oh-three-one-one. I'll say it again slowly: W, O, two, six, zero, three, one, one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:39:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "W, O, two, six, zero, three, one, one. Yes, I wrote it. Thank you, madam."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:39:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. If the cover gets worse or shifts out of place, call us right back, because that's more urgent."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:39:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will do that. You have been very kind. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:39:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Ms. Tavares. Bye now."
    }
  ],
